{"surah":101,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"arabic":"ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","translit":"AlqariAAatu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"The Striking Calamity"}},{"n":2,"arabic":"مَا ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","translit":"Ma alqariAAatu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"What is the Striking Calamity"}},{"n":3,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","translit":"Wama adraka ma alqariAAatu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity"}},{"n":4,"arabic":"يَوۡمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلۡفَرَاشِ ٱلۡمَبۡثُوثِ","translit":"Yawma yakoonu alnnasu kaalfarashi almabthoothi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed"}},{"n":5,"arabic":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلۡجِبَالُ كَٱلۡعِهۡنِ ٱلۡمَنفُوشِ","translit":"Watakoonu aljibalu kaalAAihni almanfooshi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up"}},{"n":6,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتۡ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","translit":"Faamma man thaqulat mawazeenuhu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds]"}},{"n":7,"arabic":"فَهُوَ فِي عِيشَةࣲ رَّاضِيَةࣲ‏","translit":"Fahuwa fee AAeeshatin radiyatin","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"He will be in a pleasant life"}},{"n":8,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنۡ خَفَّتۡ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","translit":"Waamma man khaffat mawazeenuhu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"But as for one whose scales are light"}},{"n":9,"arabic":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةࣱ‏","translit":"Faommuhu hawiyatun","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"His refuge will be an abyss"}},{"n":10,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهۡ","translit":"Wama adraka ma hiyah","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And what can make you know what that is"}},{"n":11,"arabic":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةُۢ","translit":"Narun hamiyatun","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"It is a Fire, intensely hot"}}]}